      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FABRICATOR (1) has been hard to follow lately, running fifth (29.79) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Gosford. Good beginner and aided by the inside draw. Looks suited here and big improvement expected. INTREPID EAGLE (2) started big odds last time but hit the ground running with a strong early split, giving a sight but fading only late to finish second (36.14) at Richmond over 622m. Comes out of a hot form race last start. Will give a great sight again. JETTY JUMPER (8) jumped wide and had a clear run last start, leading all the way to score (30.15) at The Meadows in a Grade 5 over 525m. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Bold showing expected again. ASCEND JACARANDA (3) profiles nicely here at this trip.",
